.SH NAME
gf-signed-in-user-revoke-user-auth-token - Revokes an auth token of the actual user


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf signed-in-user revoke-user-auth-token [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Revokes an auth token of the actual user

.PP
Revokes the given auth token (device) for the actual user. User of issued auth token (device) will no longer be logged in and will be required to authenticate again upon next activity.

.PP
Body schema (RevokeAuthTokenCmd):
  authTokenId  number

.PP
Response schema (RevokeUserAuthTokenOK.Payload):
  message  string


